Package: gglaplot2
Title: GLA Design Tokens, Theme and Chart Marks for ggplot2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Micheal", "Slade", , "50627681+Micheal-Slade@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The Greater London Authority design tokens as R data, with a
    ggplot2 theme, colour palettes, scales and the chart marks the City
    Intelligence Unit's web charts draw, built on them. The successor to
    gglaplot. The tokens, the typeface and the chart conventions are the
    visualisation team's, taken from their ldn-viz-tools package unchanged,
    so a chart made here and a chart on one of their sites read as one
    system.
